        "TileImage": "$($repository f2cdae94-9505-4d57-a70f-515ddc234878).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. The ICA has ordered a total clean sweep of Whittleton Creek to eliminate Janus, Nolan Cassidy, and his personal bodyguard, Gunther Mueller. While Janus and Cassidy are the main targets, tactical command dictates that Mueller—a battle-hardened ex-KGB operative—must be neutralized to fully sanitize the area. Mueller is the last fanatical piece of Janus&apos;s brutal history as the cold-blooded Soviet spymaster who ran the KGB&apos;s Sixth Directorate. Erase his terrifying legacy.",
